  "category": "ancestry",
  "text": "You were born with a layer of scales across your entire body that resemble those of your draconic progenitor. When you're unarmored, the scales give you a +1 item bonus to AC with a Dexterity cap of +3. The item bonus to AC increases to +2 at 5th level. The item bonus to AC from these scales is cumulative with armor potency runes on your explorer's clothing, the Mystic Armor spell, or Bands of Force.\n\n---\nSpecial You can select this feat only at 1st level, and you can't retrain into or out of this feat.",
